From 4236332c2c1f982d2a1d18efb6ca70634843766a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nathan Singh <nathan.singh@hotmail.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 15:25:04 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] Arena: cup rewards are equipment only, more of it, and the
 Djinn reset after a fight

Rewards given in a cup are gear only (the Power Bread and the Mystic Draught are gone). More
equipment is added: the Unicorn Ring (Mogall) and what the cup's enemies drop in the story:
Prophet's Hat (Cerberus, Tolbi), Aura Gloves (Magicore, Lunpa), Feathered Robe, Spiked
Armor, Blessed Mace and Zodiac Wand (Lighthouse). scripts/cup-drops.py lists the drops.

After each fight every Djinni is set again and the party's recovery list is emptied
(ArenaMenu_RestoreDjinn, after a win and on arriving after a loss), whether or not the cup
heals.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
